[D]And [A]strength to [E7]strength op[A]pose.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[A]Stand up, stand up for [D]Jesus,
[D]Stand [A]in His [E]strength [A]a[E]lone;
[E]The [A]arm of flesh will [D]fail you,
[D]Ye [A]dare not [E7]trust your [A]own.
